  "description": "Sundey Graftwo is a playful and vibrant bubble graffiti font that adds a touch of whimsy to your designs. With rounded, bubbly characters that exude a sense of fun, this font captures the essence of carefree street art. Perfect for injecting a burst of energy into headlines, posters, or any creative project, Sundey Graftwo brings a lighthearted and dynamic flair to your typographic expression.\nThis font is PUA encoded which means you can access all of the amazing glyphs and ligatures with ease!",
